  "notes": [
    "This is a dated acceptance snapshot, not a guarantee of future upstream availability.",
    "Only Gemini models are served (catalog apiProvider API_PROVIDER_GOOGLE_GEMINI). Claude and GPT-OSS entries are hidden and rejected with HTTP 400; catalog/gemini_only checks this.",
    "Ad-hoc checks on the same day, with the same build: Codex CLI 0.164 completed a real file task through remote compaction (compaction_trigger) with gemini-3-flash and gemini-3.8-flash-medium.",
    "Replaying a signed Gemini function call with the original ID, a different ID or no ID all succeeded on gemini-3-flash, gemini-3.8-flash-medium and gemini-2.5-flash, so the bridge sends the call IDs it issues instead of restoring upstream IDs.",
    "Gemini accepts function names of up to 128 characters from [a-zA-Z0-9_.:-] that start with a letter or underscore.",
    "Gemini cannot turn thinking off: thinkingBudget 0 was rejected by gemini-3-flash and ignored by other models. Disabled thinking uses the model's minimum budget with thoughts hidden.",
    "Antigravity rejects requests that end with a model turn (\"Requests ending with a model turn are not supported\"), and an empty user turn is treated as missing. agy2api appends a \"Continue.\" user turn.",
    "Antigravity gates new models by client version: with User-Agent antigravity/1.0.0, gemini-3.8-flash-high returned 404 while 2.22.0 and later succeeded. The service reported antigravity/2.26.0 from the release manifest during this run.",
    "Upstream session IDs did not affect caching: Gemini reused its prefix cache across different session IDs.",
    "Antigravity answers 429 RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED to any request whose system prompt contains Claude Code's x-anthropic-billing-header line or its Claude Agent SDK identity line, whichever Gemini model is requested. agy2api forwards the prompt unchanged.",
    "Blocked: gemini-2.5-pro had no capacity (MODEL_CAPACITY_EXHAUSTED); image generation and image edit hit QUOTA_EXHAUSTED because an earlier run on the same day used the image quota (Retry-After about 3.9 hours). Generated-image replay is covered by unit tests.",
    "messages/search_routed failed once with its first prompt because the search model answered a well-known fact without searching; with a prompt that needs current information it passed four times in a row, and the recorded result is from that rerun.",
    "Stop sequences truncate text, but exact Anthropic stop_reason/stop_sequence metadata remains partial because upstream exposes only STOP.",
    "Token values are sampled response usage, not total usage across every call in a scenario.",
    "No credential values, project identifiers, generated image bytes, or opaque replay signatures are included."
  ],
